                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3befad16-987d-32d3-b483-b6a8a7672105",
                        "entry_id": "500a4034-f66f-3552-b81b-03b7ad3ba936",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To produce by means of machinofacture."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5812d1cd-cb78-4e52-ae7e-4d70c9b990bc",
                                "sense_id": "3befad16-987d-32d3-b483-b6a8a7672105",
                                "text": "In 8a ( ii ) the point is made that only man machinofactures products using blueprints and such ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "779ddc5e-3799-4e23-aa9b-d0c32405d53b",
                                "sense_id": "3befad16-987d-32d3-b483-b6a8a7672105",
                                "text": "Capital enjoys real economic ownership of the productive asset writing through its real economic ownership of the forces of production that capital uses in the direct, rationalized production of the writing-identified-writer who, according to design, must pay to become the self-purchasing alienable use-value that capital machinofactures for the purpose of transforming writing into writing-as- exploitation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "56765828-ec7e-46cb-a497-dc8b8cf00079",
                                "sense_id": "3befad16-987d-32d3-b483-b6a8a7672105",
                                "text": "But attempts to relate either of them to trends in urbanisation or increases in machinofacturing or the rise of the middle classes seem less plausible."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
